Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS: the Visual C++ 2015-2022 runtime is there -- Wine's own
; (msvcp140, vcruntime140, ucrtbase and the rest) -- as the redistributable's
; installer marks it. Installers look here before they run the
; redistributable; without these Winamp's (and others') ran it with no
; arguments, its window waited for "I agree", and a silent install hung (SG
; Store walk 2026-10-01). SG Store already treats the runtime as present.
; Both the x86 and x64 runtimes, in both registry views, where installers of
; either bitness look.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x86]
"Installed"=dword:00000001
"Version"="v14.44.35211.00"
"Major"=dword:0000000e
"Minor"=dword:0000002c
"Bld"=dword:0000898b
"Rbld"=dword:00000000

